Package: nido-ime-bridge
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libibus-1.0-5 (>= 1.5.25), vielotus (>= 2.0.8)
Recommends: ibus
Maintainer: Nido Holdings <support@nido-holdings.com>
Homepage: https://nido-holdings.com
Description: NidoOS zero-underline IBus bridge for Sen Viet (VieLotusIM)
 Native IBus engine for NidoOS that dynamically loads libVieLotusCAPI.so.0
 from upstream vielotus and commits Vietnamese diacritics directly without
 ever activating IBus/Wayland preedit underlines.
 .
 Uses atomic surrounding-text replacement where verified, and an ordered
 zero-race Backspace + commit pipeline (IBus forward-key or /dev/uinput)
 on Chromium/Electron, Firefox, and terminal applications while preserving
 full compatibility with upstream vielotus-settings and APT upgrades.
